---
description: Prefer Graphify for codebase orientation; keep the graph current
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo has a Graphify knowledge graph at `graphify-out/`.

- For architecture / “how does X relate to Y” questions, prefer `graphify query`, `graphify path`, and `graphify explain` before broad Grep.
- After meaningful code changes, run `graphify update .` (AST-only) or rely on the post-commit hook.
- Rebuild with the graphify skill / `graphify extract . --code-only` if `graphify-out/graph.json` is missing.
- `.graphifyignore` excludes `.agents/` skill packages.
